s. Use your mouse to choose the set of letters that is different.<div><br><\/div><div>Here are some examples:<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>1) NOPQ &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; DEFL &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ABCD &nbsp; &nbsp; HIJK &nbsp; &nbsp; UVWX<\/div><div>2) NLIK &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; PLIK &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; QLIK &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; THIK &nbsp; &nbsp; VLIK<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>In Example 1, four of the sets have letters in alphabetical order, so the letter set DEFL does not follow this rule. In Example 2, four of the sets contain the letter L, so the letter set THIK does not follow this rule.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>You will have 4 minutes for this task, with a clock counting down at the bottom of the screen. After four minutes elapse, you will automatically move on to the next part. &nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Please click the arrow to start.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q140","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Each problem in this task has five sets of letters with four letters in each set. Four of the set...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID210"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0id1vFV4F70Fklo","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID211","SecondaryAttribute":"Which letter set is different?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which letter set is different?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q142","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Which letter set is different?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"QPPQ"},"3":{"Display":"HGHH"},"4":{"Display":"TTTU"},"5":{"Display":"DDDE"},"6":{"Display":"MLMM"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","3","4","5","6