 the carpet he was standing on.\r\nExplain briefly how not a single drop of wine was spilled.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Easy 1","QuestionID":"QID315","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"A very tall man was holding up a wine decanter way above his head. He let go of it, and it droppe...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":8,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0id1vFV4F70Fklo","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID316","SecondaryAttribute":"When Josh leaves the factory where he works, all he has ever taken with him is a toolbox containi...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"When Josh leaves the factory where he works,\nall he has ever taken with him is a toolbox containing only his very own tools.\nNo lunch box, no backpack, no bags, nothing in his pockets, etc.\nYet, after a month he is arrested for grand theft from the site.\nExplain briefly what Josh was stealing.<br>Please write <b>below<\/b> the questions you are thinking of when trying to solve the riddle <br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Easy 2","QuestionID":"QID316","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"When Josh leaves the factory where he works, all he has ever taken with him is a toolbox containi...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":29,"NextAnswerId":3,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0id1vFV4F70Fklo","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID317","SecondaryAttribute":"Laura took a multiple-choice test. She barely speaks, reads, or understands English, and had nobo...","TertiaryAttribute":null,